<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85595" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠώνῠμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλυ-</span></b> 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Mém. Miss. Arch.
				Perse</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				20.91
			</span></i> (Susa, Hymn to Apollo): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>):— <i>having many names,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				238a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				489a2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			divinities, <i>worshipped under many names,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Cer.
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1115
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				320
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.109
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἷς ὢν ὁ θεὸς π. ἐστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					401a12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Secund.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Gramm.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π., τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνώνυμον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Speus.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				36.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				69.1
			</span></i> (pl.), Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.390H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of great name,</i> i.e. <i>famous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
				82
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				785
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π., τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλξίνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.85
			</span></i>.</div>
